{"id":"n65330-1-5","stage":5,"title":"수소문 · 打听","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65330-1-5-1","ko":"입원할 병원은 찾았어요?","zh":"已经找到要住院的医院了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"입원할","meaning":"住院","explanation":"입원하다：住院；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"입원하다","audio":"/audio/73dca9be6211daff3810.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62373","senseId":"1","lemma":"입원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입원할","audio":"/audio/86cacaea922ddf2c5be2.mp3"}},{"text":"병원은","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원은","audio":"/audio/5470b4613bd2d2146bed.mp3"}},{"text":"찾았어요?","meaning":"拜访，寻访，探访","explanation":"찾다：拜访，寻访，探访；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"5","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾았어요","audio":"/audio/9fd43a34a16d05a77ce2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"73dca9be6211daff","term":"입원하다","zh":"住院","audio":"/audio/73dca9be6211daff3810.mp3","entryId":"62373","definition":"为了治病而在医院住一段时间。","pronunciation":["이붠하다"]},{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","entryId":"62271","definition":"具备相关设施、由医生和护士治疗病人的地方。","pronunciation":["병ː원"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"拜访，寻访，探访","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了见某人或看某地而去相关场所。","pronunciation":["찯따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0b9a4344061bc8bb3693.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65330-1-5-2","ko":"지금 제일 좋은 병원을 수소문 중이에요.","zh":"我现在正在四处打听最好的医院。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在，这会儿","explanation":"지금：现在，这会儿。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df1